DESCRIPTION:November 26\, 2026 11:00am - 3:00pm Menu: Teriyaki Salmon & St
 ir-Fried Vegetables Join us on Thursday\, November 26\, 2026 \, as we make
  Teriyaki Salmon and Stir-fried vegetables. This Teriyaki Salmon recipe is
  quick\, easy\, and very tasty\, and doesn't require marinating the salmon
  for a period of time before cooking. Participants will also make a stir-f
 ry that compliments the teriyaki salmon\, using a variety of vegetables an
 d mushrooms to create their own personalized stir-fry Cost is $30 + HST fo
 r JCCC members and $35 + HST for non-members of the JCCC and must be paid 
 to secure your spot. Only 18 registrations spots are available. Please be 
 advised no refunds or credits will be given once you have registered. Plea
 se bring your own head covering and apron. Registration opens Thursday Oct
 ober 22 and ends on Thursday November 19. You can register online or in pe
 rson at Reception. Registration is through the Portal: Register Here Novem
 ber class registration starts from Thursday October 22\, 2026 at noon.\n\n
 Categories: Workshop
